{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0177vJa1c9A3gnziQY6kD8Tx","type":"tool_result","content":"-->\n\n```agda\n-- The type of I-ary operations on A.  Arity first, carrier second, so that\n-- `Op (Fin 2)` partially applies as \"the type of binary operations\" on any given A.\nOp : Type 𝓥 → Type a → Type (a ⊔ 𝓥)\nOp I A = (I → A) → A\n```\n\nFor example, the `I`-*ary projection operations* on `A` are represented as\ninhabitants of the type `Op I A` as follows.\n\n```agda\n-- Example (projections)\nπ : {I : Type 𝓥} {A : Type a } → I → Op I A\nπ i = λ x → x i\n```\n\nOccasionally we want to extract the arity of a given operation symbol.\n\n```agda","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05ad0c34-a406-498a-b27e-e57536a478c9","uuid":"ec5ac5fd-b05d-43c1-b602-492d57479268","timestamp":"2026-09-29T06:39:40.480Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"-->\n\n```agda\n-- The type of I-ary operations on A.  Arity first, carrier second, so that\n-- `Op (Fin 2)` partially applies as \"the type of binary operations\" on any given A.\nOp : Type 𝓥 → Type a → Type (a ⊔ 𝓥)\nOp I A = (I → A) → A\n```\n\nFor example, the `I`-*ary projection operations* on `A` are represented as\ninhabitants of the type `Op I A` as follows.\n\n```agda\n-- Example (projections)\nπ : {I : Type 𝓥} {A : Type a } → I → Op I A\nπ i = λ x → x i\n```\n\nOccasionally we want to extract the arity of a given operation symbol.\n\n```agda","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
